@* The money colours from FinanceTracker.Design as CSS variables, so stylesheets and components colour money as
   the charts and PDFs do without the values being written twice. Rendered once in the page's head. *@
<style>
    :root {
        --ft-money-in: @MoneyColours.MoneyIn;
        --ft-money-out: @MoneyColours.MoneyOut;
        --ft-money-neutral: @MoneyColours.Neutral;
    }
</style>
